sysroot runtime/header and converter sources remain. Full archives preserve
upstream copyright/license files, not just these extracted license summaries.

See docs/v04-license-inventory.md and release/generated-license-evidence.json
for exact guest/generated identities, retained-function evidence, limitations
and repeat commands. Symbol counts are not a complete final linked-file SBOM,
